```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Failure detected] --> B[Classify failure]
    B --> C{Security or authorization failure?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Block and audit]
    C -->|No| E{External write outcome unknown?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Reconcile before further writes]
    E -->|No| G{Repairable input or output?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Bounded correction]
    G -->|No| I{Transient and retry-safe?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Retry within deadline and budget]
    I -->|No| K{Approved fallback available?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Validate compatibility and route]
    K -->|No| M[Defer, abstain or escalate]
```
